      {
        "parameters": {
          "content": "## Branch 1 - Launch from the CRM\nThe CRM posts {campaign_id, location, lead_count} here, n8n answers 200 instantly, scrapes leads (Apify), saves them to the CRM, emails them (Smartlead) and sends a WhatsApp intro 2 hours later.\n\nApify: put your actor ID in the URL. The CRM sends a search plan (keywords, job titles, exclusions, seniority, location, count); rename the keys in the Apify body if your actor uses other input names. The CRM re-filters every result.\n\nFill in ONLY the **CRM Settings** node, then attach credentials to: Apify, Smartlead, both WhatsApp nodes and the ChatGPT model (OpenAI).",
          "color": 3
        },
        "id": "42393fff-e2af-454a-a276-e94d42ea263e",
        "name": "Sticky Note 4eb62f41",
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
        "typeVersion": 1,
        "position": [
          1392,
          1648
        ]
      },
      {
        "parameters": {
          "content": "## Staged outreach\nEmail -> wait 2h -> WhatsApp intro. Every step reports back to the CRM (X-Leadgen-Token). A failed intro is logged but the prospect is NOT marked messaged.\n\nApify: put your actor ID in the URL. The CRM sends a search plan (keywords, job titles, exclusions, seniority, location, count); rename the keys in the Apify body if your actor uses other input names. The CRM re-filters every result.\n\nFill in ONLY the **CRM Settings** node, then attach credentials to: Apify, Smartlead, both WhatsApp nodes and the ChatGPT model (OpenAI).",
          "color": 4
        },
        "id": "1d45c33e-497a-48f3-b525-dd01b649aadf",
