      {
        "parameters": {
          "content": "## Inbound WhatsApp agent\nOnly prospects the CRM already knows get an AI reply (ChatGPT + memory). Strangers are ignored. Every message and any delivery failure is logged to the CRM.\n\nApify: put your actor ID in the URL. The CRM sends a search plan (keywords, job titles, exclusions, seniority, location, count); rename the keys in the Apify body if your actor uses other input names. The CRM re-filters every result.\n\nFill in ONLY the **CRM Settings** node, then attach credentials to: Apify, Smartlead, both WhatsApp nodes and the ChatGPT model (OpenAI).",
